WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.060
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:19.843
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:29.658
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:39.065
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:49.609
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:56.578
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.191
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:06.026
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.693
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:18.868
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:36.195
<i>TOUKAROU</i>

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:49.339
Our customer is leaving.

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:00.508
Master Hashimoto,
did you enjoy yourself?

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:04.519
I've tasted paradise.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.952
Then you won't fight anymore?

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:11.120
How could I? Now that I know about this
place, I wouldn't want to go to battle...

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:15.463
...and die a meaningless death.
Not even the stupidest person would.

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:20.670
But the world is still a rough place,
and I can't get rid of my katana...

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:21.967
Huh?

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:25.044
I thought I put it on earlier...

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:26.212
Mikan!

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:27.310
Mikan!

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.074
Where are Master Hashimito's valuables?

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.410
What?

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:33.646
I don't know.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:38.118
You were holding on to them.
Give them back right now!

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:42.860
Don't make me repeat myself.
If you insist that you don't have them...

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:45.764
...I can't let you
stay here at Toukarou.

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:52.331
Please accept our apologies.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:57.501
Don't worry about it.
I almost forgot about it myself.

00:02:57.644 --> 00:03:01.205
That's how wonderful this place is.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.946
Mikan, why would you want a weapon?

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:14.956
Because, you never know
when evil people will attack us.

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:18.688
If that should happen, I will
protect us. Don't you believe in me?

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:20.458
Of course I do!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.467
I do, but...

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:31.466
<i>Episode 5
Explosion! Kensousen, Kurenai Touka</i>

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:34.246
Yatchan, you're mistaken.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.872
You've got the wrong idea about Tenshi!

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.485
Then what kind person is she?

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:46.191
In this time of war, she believes if even
one person could put down his weapon...

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:48.850
She sent you out on this journey, right?

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:53.694
She expects her pawns to do all her work
for her. She won't lift a finger herself.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.926
That's the kind of person she is.

00:03:56.936 --> 00:04:00.303
Tenshi has her reasons.

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:03.235
Stop defending her.

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:07.040
I don't know what her reasons are,
but who puts a price on...

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.541
...the head of a person she trusts?

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:12.912
Take another look at this.

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:16.044
I'm sure there's an explanation.

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:20.291
Well, now that you're wanted
and everyone knows your face...

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:22.824
...it would be a good idea
to lay low for a while.

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:23.725
Yes.

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:28.332
A wagon load of women!

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:31.403
There's no escaping from us Tenmatoh!

00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:32.864
Tenmatoh?

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:36.407
Let's take off those clothes.

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:39.612
I'll take them off for you!

00:04:45.885 --> 00:04:48.854
You didn't see my face, did you?

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:51.924
<i>All he saw were her panties.</i>

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:55.458
Who the hell are you?
Are you one of them?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.029
Damn it!

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:03.429
Are you okay?

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:05.002
Are you hurt?

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:06.533
No... huh?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.568
I don't know where you come from,
Missy.

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:14.545
But you got guts standing up
to the Tenmatoh!

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:18.042
I'm glad. So you don't know who I am.

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:19.243
What?

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.782
Get her!

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:27.489
Shit!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.958
We won't forget this!

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:33.531
I broke a sweat again.

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:34.361
Um...

00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:35.162
Yes?

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:38.798
How can we ever thank you?

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:41.038
Thank you so much.

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:44.802
Please, we have to help
each other in times of need!

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:49.739
But more importantly, is there any
place nearby where I can take a bath?

00:05:51.718 --> 00:05:55.017
In that case, please come to our inn.

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:56.687
Huh? An inn?

00:05:56.789 --> 00:05:59.849
Yes, and there's no charge, so please!

00:06:00.059 --> 00:06:02.152
Can we eat for free too?

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:03.417
Yatchan!

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.661
Let's take them up on it.

00:06:05.965 --> 00:06:06.829
But...

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:10.396
Our baths are famous.

00:06:10.703 --> 00:06:13.763
Then we will take you up on your offer.

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:15.533
Cheapskate.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.377
An inn?

00:06:34.594 --> 00:06:35.856
Wow!

00:06:35.995 --> 00:06:37.656
This is our inn.

00:06:39.165 --> 00:06:40.860
Toukarou.

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:52.872
Is this... a brothel?

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:55.047
<i>PLEASURE PALACE, TOUKAROU</i>

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:57.813
This is amazing!

00:06:57.917 --> 00:06:59.782
It looks like fun!

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:04.049
Is it your first time
in a place like this?

00:07:04.323 --> 00:07:07.383
As if! I've been loads of times!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.728
<i>FIRST TIME</i>

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:10.691
Huh?

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.363
Hmm...

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:16.800
What huge boobs! You have a nice body!

00:07:16.903 --> 00:07:18.336
How old are you?

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:19.530
Sixteen.

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:20.800
Ouch.

00:07:20.873 --> 00:07:21.999
Mikan!

00:07:22.141 --> 00:07:24.609
She's a very important guest.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.702
What, she's not a new girl?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.446
I'm Rushuna Tendo,
nice to meet you.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.916
Hey, don't give your name up so easily.

00:07:32.985 --> 00:07:34.850
Oh, you're right.

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:38.257
Oh, so she's just a customer.

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:41.859
That's too bad. She's got the goods...

00:07:42.128 --> 00:07:46.758
She came to our rescue when these
bandits called the Tenmatoh attacked us.

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:48.366
Tenmatoh, you said?

00:07:50.436 --> 00:07:52.961
I see... a guest.

00:07:53.239 --> 00:07:57.107
It's decided then.
I'll look after these guests.

00:07:57.243 --> 00:07:58.878
Mikan, are you sure?

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:00.209
<i>No problem.
Mikan, are you sure?</i>

00:08:00.513 --> 00:08:01.810
Follow me.

00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:05.413
Mikan... What is she up to this time?

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:06.883
That's...

00:08:15.061 --> 00:08:16.961
How is the temperature?

00:08:17.063 --> 00:08:19.395
It's great, thank you.

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:25.737
I'll leave your clothes here.

00:08:25.838 --> 00:08:26.770
Okay!

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:41.144
That was easy.

00:08:41.287 --> 00:08:43.778
But what an old gun!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:46.017
Oh, who cares. A gun is a gun.

00:08:46.158 --> 00:08:47.989
Um, Mikan?

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:49.955
Wh-what?

00:08:52.265 --> 00:08:54.233
Is this what I'm supposed to put on?

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:56.995
That's all we have here.

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.996
I'll wash your clothes for you.

00:09:00.306 --> 00:09:03.332
Thank you, but does it look good?

00:09:03.442 --> 00:09:06.809
Yes it does! You could even work here!

00:09:06.913 --> 00:09:07.947
And, one more thing.

00:09:07.947 --> 00:09:08.971
<i>What?
And, one more thing.</i>

00:09:09.148 --> 00:09:11.981
Would you mind giving my gun back?

00:09:12.952 --> 00:09:14.351
Huh? This?

00:09:14.487 --> 00:09:16.546
I'll hold on to this!

00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:19.351
It's not a toy. Please give it back.

00:09:21.193 --> 00:09:25.152
Fine then, I guess I'll give it back...

00:09:28.701 --> 00:09:31.932
Catch me if you can!

00:09:36.375 --> 00:09:37.171
Ha!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.871
No problem!

00:09:43.716 --> 00:09:46.048
Mikan, you're fast.

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:54.485
Don't underestimate me just cuz
I'm a kid. I know how to use a gun.

00:09:55.294 --> 00:09:58.889
In order to shoot, you have
to pull the hammer back first.

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:02.199
Huh?

00:10:03.169 --> 00:10:06.036
It's so stiff. Is it broken?

00:10:06.205 --> 00:10:10.801
I don't think you can do it.
I have it set pretty tight.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:11.604
Huh?

00:10:12.345 --> 00:10:15.803
So that I can feel
the weight of a life.

00:10:17.283 --> 00:10:18.910
...weight of a life?

00:10:19.885 --> 00:10:23.844
If you're going to shoot someone,
you have to have a certain awareness.

00:10:26.792 --> 00:10:28.851
Can you get up, Mikan?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.854
To-Touka.

00:10:35.668 --> 00:10:39.297
Mikan, didn't you hear
my warning this morning?

00:10:39.572 --> 00:10:42.803
But the Tenmatoh bastards are close!

00:10:43.209 --> 00:10:44.141
Tenmatoh?

00:10:44.243 --> 00:10:46.302
That's why I need a weapon!

00:10:46.412 --> 00:10:47.140
Mikan!

00:10:47.513 --> 00:10:50.141
There's nothing you can do
about it anyway!

00:10:50.249 --> 00:10:52.342
I thought I told you to leave it to me!

00:10:52.551 --> 00:10:53.279
But!

00:10:53.486 --> 00:10:54.919
No "buts."

00:10:56.088 --> 00:11:00.047
I have some business to
discuss with this woman.

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:01.090
Go.

00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:03.658
You're...

00:11:03.763 --> 00:11:04.491
Yes.

00:11:05.297 --> 00:11:07.231
...the one with the price on her head.

00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:08.527
Price on her head?

00:11:08.768 --> 00:11:10.895
That's a misunderstanding!

00:11:11.137 --> 00:11:14.470
I haven't done anything
to make Tenshi go after me.

00:11:14.573 --> 00:11:19.408
I'll ask your dead body if
it's a misunderstanding or not!

00:11:42.935 --> 00:11:45.563
It causes an explosion the
moment it makes contact...

00:11:45.671 --> 00:11:48.299
It's the Kensousen, one of
the Ten Sacred Weapons.

00:11:48.407 --> 00:11:50.102
<i>KENSOUSEN</i>

00:11:50.242 --> 00:11:51.834
If she can use that...

00:12:02.621 --> 00:12:03.610
Touka!

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:08.216
Rushuna Tendo.

00:12:09.261 --> 00:12:10.228
She's...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.524
Madam...

00:12:15.768 --> 00:12:18.669
You're one of the
Juttensen, are you not?

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:21.706
<i>JUTTENSEN
Ten Heavenly Enlightened</i>

00:12:22.007 --> 00:12:25.602
The ten strongest Senshi in the world
who serve and protect Tenshi...

00:12:25.745 --> 00:12:27.178
...the Juttensen.

00:12:27.913 --> 00:12:31.713
It is my understanding that
you are the Senshi with the lance.

00:12:33.219 --> 00:12:35.710
That was a long time ago.

00:12:36.188 --> 00:12:38.986
If that's the case,
then please tell me.

00:12:39.091 --> 00:12:42.618
Why would the
Tento Security Sector be after me?

00:12:42.728 --> 00:12:46.357
Why did Tenshi put a price on my head?

00:12:48.467 --> 00:12:49.559
Enough talking.

00:12:52.371 --> 00:12:53.235
Hey!

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.630
What are you doing?

00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:59.711
That's what I'd like to know!
What's all the ruckus out there?

00:12:59.912 --> 00:13:02.039
I can't eat in peace!

00:13:02.181 --> 00:13:05.173
Your comrade is in a pinch!

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:20.925
Check out that weapon. Is that a lance?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.465
That's it?

00:13:22.601 --> 00:13:24.228
Aren't you worried?

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:27.498
It's a gun against a lance.
It's no contest.

00:13:27.773 --> 00:13:30.708
The lady with the lance
looks pretty intense.

00:13:30.843 --> 00:13:33.403
But Rushuna's honed
her skills in battle.

00:13:33.546 --> 00:13:35.776
There's nothing to worry about.

00:13:36.115 --> 00:13:37.673
Now where's my food...

00:13:37.783 --> 00:13:38.477
Hey!

00:13:38.684 --> 00:13:43.986
But now that they know there's a price
on her head, we can't stay here for long.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.283
I better eat while I can.

00:13:48.093 --> 00:13:51.062
You've got some good moves...

00:13:51.197 --> 00:13:54.257
But running will only get you killed.

00:13:54.533 --> 00:13:56.023
I told you, I...

00:13:56.168 --> 00:13:56.964
Come one!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.375
Do I have to shoot?

00:14:10.883 --> 00:14:12.748
Is that it?

00:14:13.152 --> 00:14:16.553
Is that the inn where
the girls you let go live?

00:14:16.789 --> 00:14:17.847
Yes!

00:14:18.123 --> 00:14:22.287
Nice place. It looks like
we can have some fun there.

00:14:22.561 --> 00:14:24.085
Great!

00:14:24.296 --> 00:14:27.595
We'll make that whole
pleasure palace ours!

00:14:28.634 --> 00:14:31.034
Professor, we're counting on you.

00:14:38.811 --> 00:14:40.938
Getting serious, are we?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.742
Only because you won't stop.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:48.411
I can't let a wanted woman
stay at my place.

00:14:48.587 --> 00:14:50.646
I said that was a misunderstanding!

00:14:51.223 --> 00:14:54.852
I can't do it. She's using the
chains as a shield. I have to...

00:14:55.261 --> 00:14:57.229
...dive into the chains.

00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:07.236
She's done for!

00:15:08.707 --> 00:15:09.503
What!

00:15:14.513 --> 00:15:15.844
Just her sash?

00:15:27.059 --> 00:15:29.050
She's amazing!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.563
Just a mere scrape?

00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:40.728
It's been a long time since I've met
someone who could dodge my lance.

00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:43.798
You're finished!

00:15:47.546 --> 00:15:49.013
She's slower!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.322
Touka...

00:16:13.706 --> 00:16:14.468
Wait.

00:16:16.075 --> 00:16:17.303
I give up.

00:16:17.476 --> 00:16:21.742
If I'm causing trouble, I will leave
right away. Please forgive me.

00:16:24.116 --> 00:16:26.141
I-I see.

00:16:32.925 --> 00:16:35.519
I'm very sorry.

00:16:37.029 --> 00:16:38.257
Hold on.

00:16:39.465 --> 00:16:41.399
I was wrong.

00:16:43.402 --> 00:16:47.031
Rushuna Tendo, I believe you.

00:16:47.239 --> 00:16:48.206
Miss Touka...

00:16:48.707 --> 00:16:53.337
You saw that I'm not well
and you went easy on me.

00:16:54.713 --> 00:16:58.809
But don't tell my girls.

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:03.186
No one knows. I don't
want to worry them.

00:17:05.824 --> 00:17:08.122
You sure erased my will to fight.

00:17:08.227 --> 00:17:13.392
You're following the teachings of Tenshi.
There's no way you are a traitor.

00:17:13.532 --> 00:17:14.430
You mean...

00:17:14.566 --> 00:17:17.091
The folks in the capital
must have made a mistake.

00:17:17.603 --> 00:17:21.801
No, even in the capital there
are people with bad intentions.

00:17:22.441 --> 00:17:23.430
Touka!

00:17:24.676 --> 00:17:25.574
Touka!

00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:29.139
I don't think she's a bad guy.

00:17:29.281 --> 00:17:32.409
Madam, I don't think so either.

00:17:32.785 --> 00:17:34.912
She's not a bad person.

00:17:35.954 --> 00:17:37.080
I know.

00:17:37.923 --> 00:17:42.758
In order to strip men of their
armor, it helps to have a girl like this.

00:17:43.862 --> 00:17:49.425
I started this pleasure palace because
I was following the teachings of Tenshi.

00:17:50.836 --> 00:17:55.273
Sex appeal is the best thing
to strip men of their armor.

00:17:56.108 --> 00:18:00.272
Although sometimes a little boy
comes around and refuses to take...

00:18:00.412 --> 00:18:02.380
...his armor off.

00:18:09.455 --> 00:18:12.356
Okay! I'll leave right away!

00:18:12.491 --> 00:18:14.789
Yajiro Kojima, right?

00:18:16.328 --> 00:18:20.890
Because she's with a swordsman like
you, this misunderstanding came about.

00:18:21.133 --> 00:18:24.364
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:18:24.603 --> 00:18:26.400
We've never even met.

00:18:26.705 --> 00:18:30.471
Word gets around. You're pretty
well known on the battlefield...

00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:32.577
...Tiger of the Rear Guard.

00:18:32.711 --> 00:18:33.905
Madam!

00:18:34.246 --> 00:18:36.908
Madam, big trouble! It's them!

00:18:37.382 --> 00:18:40.351
The bandits from
this afternoon are here!

00:18:41.086 --> 00:18:43.748
Hey, hey, hey, lady...

00:18:45.157 --> 00:18:47.318
Calling us bandits is not nice.

00:18:47.426 --> 00:18:50.725
We are customers, and therefore, gods.

00:18:51.497 --> 00:18:53.727
Greet us with more heart!

00:18:54.967 --> 00:18:59.199
Madam, you need to train them better!
Where is the Madam?

00:19:00.339 --> 00:19:02.432
I'm the Madam.

00:19:04.143 --> 00:19:05.542
You're...

00:19:06.578 --> 00:19:07.943
Touka Kurenai.

00:19:11.049 --> 00:19:13.017
It's been a while.

00:19:13.118 --> 00:19:17.885
Not bad, building a place like this
in just one year. Impressive.

00:19:18.023 --> 00:19:19.991
What do you want?

00:19:20.225 --> 00:19:24.389
We reserve the right to refuse
to serve violent people.

00:19:25.464 --> 00:19:27.056
How unkind.

00:19:33.038 --> 00:19:35.666
We've come as customers.

00:19:35.941 --> 00:19:37.033
It's him...

00:19:37.743 --> 00:19:38.937
It's him!

00:19:39.211 --> 00:19:40.235
Mikan!

00:19:40.412 --> 00:19:42.243
I won't forgive him.

00:19:42.447 --> 00:19:44.847
Let's let Miss Touka handle this.

00:19:45.184 --> 00:19:46.947
Not him.

00:19:49.221 --> 00:19:50.654
You want to drink?

00:19:50.722 --> 00:19:53.748
Fine, let me arrange for a table.

00:19:53.992 --> 00:19:58.486
You've become so very understanding.

00:19:59.264 --> 00:20:03.530
This is a great opportunity.
Why don't I make you mine?

00:20:04.303 --> 00:20:07.898
It'll be easy. You just have
to entertain me while I eat.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.907
We'll run this pleasure palace.

00:20:11.843 --> 00:20:14.607
I'm trying to do you a favor, Touka.

00:20:14.746 --> 00:20:18.773
You don't want to see your
pleasure palace go to waste.

00:20:19.218 --> 00:20:21.015
Go to waste?

00:20:21.286 --> 00:20:24.517
If it were to be destroyed or something...

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:29.192
Let go!

00:20:29.361 --> 00:20:32.023
He killed my parents!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.462
I want vengeance!

00:20:36.201 --> 00:20:38.965
Let me have my revenge!

00:20:39.671 --> 00:20:40.535
No.

00:20:41.139 --> 00:20:42.128
No.

00:20:47.879 --> 00:20:52.179
Come on Touka, get rid of
these pissy little kids...

00:20:55.821 --> 00:20:58.449
What a disadvantage it is to be a man.

00:20:59.691 --> 00:21:00.419
Boss!

00:21:00.892 --> 00:21:02.086
You!

00:21:03.729 --> 00:21:07.665
If you want to fight,
I'll take you on, boys...

00:21:07.966 --> 00:21:11.333
Whenever, wherever,
as often as you like...

00:21:13.338 --> 00:21:16.705
If we're going to do it,
don't bother with the scraps...

00:21:16.975 --> 00:21:19.569
...bring on the real men!

00:21:20.679 --> 00:21:21.976
Crap!

00:21:30.889 --> 00:21:31.913
Why?

00:21:32.624 --> 00:21:34.854
Why won't you kill them?

00:21:42.668 --> 00:21:44.431
Damn Touka!

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.506
Does she really think I'm
going to back down that easy?

00:21:48.607 --> 00:21:49.369
Hey.

00:21:49.474 --> 00:21:50.168
Yes.

00:22:15.267 --> 00:22:24.903
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:25.977 --> 00:22:35.648
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:36.955 --> 00:22:42.188
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:42.361 --> 00:22:46.422
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:47.499 --> 00:22:55.235
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:55.574 --> 00:22:57.667
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:57.943 --> 00:23:03.074
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:03.281 --> 00:23:08.719
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:18.921
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:19.264 --> 00:23:30.072
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:30.242 --> 00:23:40.846
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.021 --> 00:23:44.989
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:45.457 --> 00:23:50.190
Enemies attack Toukarou. They are
after both Toukarou and my head.

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:53.398
I must live up to
Miss Touka's belief in me.

00:23:53.932 --> 00:23:58.164
A strange weapon that appears
out of nowhere... it's a robot!

00:23:58.403 --> 00:24:02.533
Can we beat something like this?
And my panties came off!

00:24:02.941 --> 00:24:08.436
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
The Balloonist. Mikan's Revenge.

00:24:08.680 --> 00:24:10.944
Would you like to join me?
